Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Partying is\Nweakness for the soul my friend so I try and avoid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.72,0:00:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have given every\Nsingle thing, every ounce of my life to this craft, to perfecting my craft and I continue to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.02,0:00:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And in the process\NI have lost my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.97,0:00:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,To regular\Nsociety, to people who wake up at 9am, who clock out at 5pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,they would look at\Nme and say I've lost my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.06,0:00:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But me, I have\Nfound it almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.37,0:00:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Conor\NMcGregor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a professional\NMMA fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.85,0:00:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is to be\Nworld lightweight champion in the UFC.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.73,0:00:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My dream is to be\Nnumber one.
